<title>POLAND: Polfa Kutno Q2 net falls to PLN 1.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Polfa Kutno Q2 net falls to PLN 1.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polfa Kutno preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     8.28   vs    7.05</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 5.57   vs    7.65</p>
<p>    net profit			     1.67   vs    4.94</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Polfa Kutno SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     57.02   vs   40.79</p>
<p>    costs of sales			37.15   vs   26.95</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     3.89   vs    2.72</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.55   vs    2.20</p>
<p>    financial costs			4.26   vs    1.60</p>
<p>    investment			     8.47   vs    3.05</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    16.47   vs   14.92</p>
